        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Guango mansei nahnun guango,",
            "Damloumei pu Raguang khou;",
            "Lat hei gaipui ringpui lat re,",
            "Ai phung guang the guang king o.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Hei nade gaimei ringpui lat,",
            "Hei nade bumang ring khang mu;",
            "Raguang Nah Jisu Khrista 0({,",
            "Aniu khang rui tilou the.",
            "",
            "2. Mundan rakhang napkao ngaimei,",
            "Gan ngammo kapumma 0({;",
            "Hei 0({ gai khang gang khang mak ge,",
            "Hei 0({ man tuange nang khang.",
            "",
            "3. Latjan sukhang tingmik nathe,",
            "Katumma lunglai latho;",
            "Panti tingmik hei luai pukhou,",
            "Guang puni latjan tingmik.",
            "",
            "4. Latjan sukhou khuai mak khang mu,",
            "Jisu khou gutmei nade;",
            "Hei 0({ rammak baimei thu mak khe,",
            "Jisu nade ring khang mu.",
            "",
            "5. Kei puni kaguang Khrista 0({,",
            "Tingkkauh thanmei nun guai le;",
            "Bumang kapum khuam kariu na,",
            "Latjan suni kapum ta."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
